Optional H3 X2 decoder (0.7.0)
  Model and reference design: speach1sdef178/MiniMax-H3-X2-Detail-VAE,
  https://huggingface.co/speach1sdef178/MiniMax-H3-X2-Detail-VAE
  Revision: af8c92d267c6849fec5032c35a65d5766737b338
  Weights retain the MiniMax H3 Community License and the author's NOTICE;
  both notices are fetched with the separately supplied weights.
  The independently implemented MLX decoder uses the existing H3 VAE core,
  lossless native key mappings and RGB PixelShuffle. The separate B32
  source-image enhancement branch is not used by this feature.
  ComfyUI-H3-X2-Stream was reviewed for architectural comparison; no CUDA,
  ConvRot, NVENC or ComfyUI runtime code from that GPL-3.0 project is bundled.
